# Frame budget guard: run, jump over pits, land on platforms, fall into a pit.
press right 60
press right+up 1
press right 40
press right 100
press right+fire 1
press right 45
press left 30
press up 1
wait 40
press right 200
press right+up 1
press right 80
press left+up 1
press left 60
expect-no-dropped-frames
# Measured on a500: load ~23%, maxload 27% while running (most of it is the
# 11-value serial state line printed every frame; ~7% without it).
expect-max-load 40
